    "detailed_description": "<i>Maze Craze</i> is a fast-paced, mind-wrecking puzzle platformer that takes the great concentration of your reflexes. Solve some complex mazes without hitting the walls - an error in judgment, and it's just a game over. Levels are never the same when you have dynamic music and bright graphics for an ample experience with each playthrough. Each of the mazes that this game offers is tougher than the last, which keeps you on your toes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>High-speed precision gameplay<br></li><li>Map-induced dynamical music and colorful, graceful graphics<br></li><li>Infinite more tough mazes</li></ul><br>Can you survive the maze?",
